### Library API — manual requests
# Needs the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client).
# Start the server first:  .venv/bin/fastapi dev main.py
# Click "Send Request" above each request. Run them top to bottom: later
# requests reuse IDs from earlier responses (# @name ...). Random ISBN/email
# values make the file safe to re-run against the same library.db.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@json = application/json

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/


############################## AUTHORS ##############################

### Create an author
# @name author
POST {{baseUrl}}/authors
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "name": "Terry Pratchett",
  "bio": "English author of the Discworld series."
}

### List authors (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/authors?skip=0&limit=20

### Search authors by name
GET {{baseUrl}}/authors?name=pratchett

### Get one author
GET {{baseUrl}}/authors/1
